            "review_text": "Paradise01173015136\n1 contribution\n0\nDelicious pate, delicious chili. Service attitude is not good\nApr 2024 • Friends\nPate is delicious, chili is delicious. The cake is delicious but not crispy yet. But the service is not good. There was a time when a grabber asked for an extra piece of nylon but he didn't give me one and said he was very condescending. My family traveled 7.8 km to come here because we like the noodles here. Once when we passed by, we even bought them to take home. We eat spicy food. Even if we add a bag of chili, we don't want to give it away. Then he told me to buy a 10K bottle of chili. Okay, why don't you say it sooner to save time? If the service spirit is friendlier, customers will love the store more.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten April 13, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
