            "review_text": "True Vietnam - Gorgeous Local Experience\nHanoi, Vietnam129 contributions\n0\ngood place for Vietnamese bread\nAug 2019\nThis bread shop is very old in Hanoi. They serve traditional pate bread. The price for one pack of bread is around VND 25-40k. For who loving fat food, it is a good choice.\n It's appropriate for breakfast, brunch, lunch. \nIn addition, they provide some drinks such as: soya, beers, soft drinks, etc with reasonable price.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 12, 2019",
