            "review_title": "Review at Banh My Pho Hue",
            "review_text": "Rainy T\nSingapore, Singapore178 contributions\n0\nBest Banh My in my books!\nNov 2017 • Business\nOne of the oldest shop selling only banh mi.\n\nEvery ingredient including the baguette is home made in the shop. Pate, cooked meat, pigskin gelatin and the chilli. The baguette is so soft and fresh inside and the putter crust is just so crispy. Add a few drops or spoonful of the home made chilli sauce...HEAVEN! \n\nIt's light and fulfilling for a quick big and healthy too. \n\nMust must try!!!\nRead more\nWritten November 7, 2017",
