            "review_title": "Review at Banh My Pho Hue",
            "review_text": "Paulxx7\nSingapore, Singapore21 contributions\n0\nCheap and Good\nJul 2015 • Friends\nA non descript shop selling the popular baguette that is a must eat item when in Vietnam. \nThe baguette are freshly baked in the back kitchen and is kept warm or crisp in a small oven next to the table with all the ingredients. The special is their pate like paste and meat. If you are not comfortable with these, point to the eggs and cucumbers. \nYour baguette will be ready in a jiffy and you can eat in.\nGood place for a rest and a afternoon tea.\nRead more\nWritten July 29, 2015",
