            "review_title": "Review at Banh My Pho Hue",
            "review_text": "Willma114\n9 contributions\n0\nDelicious and Simple\nJun 2015 • Couples\nAfter a few weeks in Vietnam, we were in search of something slightly different for our daily Banh Mi intake. And this place delivered.\n\nVery simple, with barely any vegetables (which I'm told is the style in Northern Vietnam), just a baguette full of meat and a tasty chili sauce. And for around 50 cents a roll, everyone's smiling.\n\nMake sure you push the locals out of the way to keep your place in line, as this place gets busy!\nRead more\nWritten June 19, 2015",
